{"4659460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SALMON", "steam_appid": 4659460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SALMON is a speedrunning platformer with satisfying movement that really shouldn't be possible for a salmon. Flop, jump, and boost your way through strange levels, chase faster times, and compete with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/dcb57d955bbf44e7cc618b36703dea2e.poster.avif?t=1788084034\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/dcb57d955bbf44e7cc618b36703dea2e.webm?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/dcb57d955bbf44e7cc618b36703dea2e.mp4?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE SPEEDRUNING MOVEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SALMON's movement is built for improvisation, speed and ridiculousness.It's difficult at first, but in the end it feels amazing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/82cdeb82449532b93adfe00d9ed1a3cc.poster.avif?t=1788084034\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/82cdeb82449532b93adfe00d9ed1a3cc.webm?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/82cdeb82449532b93adfe00d9ed1a3cc.mp4?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE YOUR FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race other players through levels, compare times, or boost each other to get even faster times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/55d9ca3ce264706e7b488b7f2c761e5a.poster.avif?t=1788084034\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/55d9ca3ce264706e7b488b7f2c761e5a.webm?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/55d9ca3ce264706e7b488b7f2c761e5a.mp4?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE YOUR OWN LEVELS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels with the level editor, then play and share them with other players. Alternatively, contribute nothing and just play levels created by others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/9c621cfd98071851df5b144eb73a07fd.poster.avif?t=1788084034\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/9c621cfd98071851df5b144eb73a07fd.webm?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/9c621cfd98071851df5b144eb73a07fd.mp4?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flop around with the unique movement mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the strange levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reach the top of the leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock different salmon skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Race against friends or work together to get faster times.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SALMON is a speedrunning platformer with satisfying movement that really shouldn't be possible for a salmon. Flop, jump, and boost your way through strange levels, chase faster times, and compete with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/dcb57d955bbf44e7cc618b36703dea2e.poster.avif?t=1788084034\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/dcb57d955bbf44e7cc618b36703dea2e.webm?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/dcb57d955bbf44e7cc618b36703dea2e.mp4?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE SPEEDRUNING MOVEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SALMON's movement is built for improvisation, speed and ridiculousness.It's difficult at first, but in the end it feels amazing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/82cdeb82449532b93adfe00d9ed1a3cc.poster.avif?t=1788084034\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/82cdeb82449532b93adfe00d9ed1a3cc.webm?t=1788084034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/extras/82cdeb82449532b93adfe00d9ed1a3cc.mp4?t=1788084034\" type=\"vi