vels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reach the top of the leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock different salmon skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Race against friends or work together to get faster times.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are a salmon, performing platforming that feels satisfying and ridiculous. Jump off walls, race against your friends, explore the strange world. Most people don't realise how athletic salmon can be.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/a4cf147a01a4c952bfebaacaa3d11663a9c0aad5/header.jpg?t=1788084034", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/dcd585d10869b40ed0d4073a1ff56ecdd40a0752/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788084034", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659460/dcd585d10869b40ed0d4073a1ff56ecdd40a0752/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788084034", "website": "https://seasharpy.dev", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 